        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Albert Smith Sr., Wong Jing\n- Organizations: The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints (LDS Church)\n- Places: Salt Lake Valley\n- Events: dedication of This Is the Place Monument, pioneers entering the Salt Lake Valley\n\nFacts:\n- George Albert Smith Sr. was born on April 4, 1870.\n- George Albert Smith Sr. served as the eighth president of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.\n- Wong Jing was born on 3 May 1955.\n- Wong Jing is a Hong Kong film director, producer, actor, presenter, and screenwriter.\n- On 24 July 1947, George Albert Smith dedicated This Is the Place Monument.\n- The dedication marked the hundredth anniversary of the pioneers entering the Salt Lake Valley.\n- George Albert Smith Sr. died on April 4, 1951.",
